{title: You Are My All in All (FJ_175_en)}
{subtitle: Nr. 175 · English}
{tempo: 148}
{time: 4/4}
{key: F}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Jesus, [C/E]Lamb of [Dm]God, [F/A]worthy [Bb]is Your [C]name. [F]
[F]Jesus, [C/E]Lamb of [Dm]God, [F/C]worthy [C]is Your [F]name.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[F]You are my strength when I am weak. [Dm]You are the
[F/A]treasure that I [Bb]seek. [C]You are my all in [F]all.
[F]When I fall down You pick me up, [Dm]when I am
[F/A]dry You fill my [Bb]cup. [C]You are my all in [F]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Jesus, [C/E]Lamb of [Dm]God, [F/A]worthy [Bb]is Your [C]name. [F]
[F]Jesus, [C/E]Lamb of [Dm]God, [F/C]worthy [C]is Your [F]name.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[F]Bearing my guilt, my sin, my shame, [Dm]rising again I bless Your name.
[F/A]You are my all in [Bb]all. [C]
[F]Crucified Lord, Redeemer, King, [Dm]joyfully now my praise I bring.
[F/A]You are my all in [Bb]all. [C][F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Jesus, [C/E]Lamb of [Dm]God, [F/A]worthy [Bb]is Your [C]name. [F]
[F]Jesus, [C/E]Lamb of [Dm]God, [F/C]worthy [C]is Your [F]name.
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Words/music: Dennis Jernigan · © 1991 Shepherd's Heart Music}
